  "question": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0093_0d2263a7fb72.png\" style=\"width: 497px; height: 121px;\" /></p><p>Which among the above compound/s does/do not form Silver mirror when treated with Tollen&#39;s reagent?</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>III</mi><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>IV</mi><mo>)</mo></math> only",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Only <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>IV</mi><mo>)</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Only <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>II</mi><mo>)</mo></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>III</mi><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>IV</mi><mo>)</mo></math> only",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Aldehyde, alpha-hydroxy ketone and hemiacetals give positive Tollen&#39;s test. Enol which can get converted into aldehyde through tautomerism are also give positive Tollen&#39;s test.&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;is aldehyde,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>II</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;get converted into ketones through tautomerism,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>III</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;get converted into aldehyde through tautomerism and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>IV</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;is hemiacetal&nbsp;so,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>II</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;will not give positive Tollen&#39;s test.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0093_0b6ba2993e75.png\" style=\"width: 675px; height: 386px;\" /></p>"
  }
